      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angels_Camp%2C_California"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Founded in 1849 as a quartz mining town, Angels Camp produced over $20 million in gold.",
